WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:01.668
[music playing]

00:00:01.735 --> 00:00:03.203
NARRATOR: There are
far deadlier creatures

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:06.439
lurking in the undergrowth,
as I discovered when

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.675
I was out looking for firewood.

00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:11.644
This tree right here
is a perfect one.

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:12.946
See this bark?

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:18.451
It's like paper, and it just
peels off just like that.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:22.589
The bark of this birch tree
is waterproof and flammable,

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:25.992
which means it'll
burn, even in the rain.

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:27.827
[suspenseful music playing]

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:29.295
Whoa.

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:30.263
Look at that.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.866
[suspenseful music playing]

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:34.300
I did not even see that there.

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:38.271
[suspenseful music playing]

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:45.245
Look at the colors
on it, and look

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:47.113
at how it matches this lichen.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.649
It's so well camouflaged.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:54.521
But this beautiful snake
is also a deadly one.

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:59.826
[suspenseful music playing]

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:02.328
They have infrared sensing pits.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:06.266
It's a kind of sense that humans
don't have, but pit vipers do.

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:09.169
This stealth predator
can detect its prey even

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:12.505
in complete darkness, and
it's armed to the teeth.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:15.809
Look at those
things right there.

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:21.581
They have hinging, venomous,
hypodermic needles.

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:24.551
And those hypodermic
needles, those fangs,

00:01:24.617 --> 00:01:28.922
are hooked up to venom sacs
in the back of its head.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:32.192
And that venom is likely to
be some of the most powerful

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:33.359
in the world.

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:35.328
I need to be
incredibly cautious.

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:38.031
This snake is certainly
capable of delivering

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:42.902
an extremely venomous bite,
one that could even kill me.

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:45.004
It's kind of twisting up here.

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:48.741
I'm starting to push my
luck, so I'm going to release

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:50.944
it carefully and retreat.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:54.881
[suspenseful music playing]

